flowchart LR
    %% one frontmatter key, both sides
    key[Key] --> both{Both sides changed it?}
    both -- no --> one[The changed side wins]
    both -- yes --> same{Same value?}
    same -- yes --> once[Lands once]
    same -- no --> lines{Lines merge into one clean block?}
    lines -- yes --> merged[Merged]
    lines -- no --> conflict[Conflict]
